  <!-- EN: Combining zope and healroot into a paste then drying it into a powder and pressing it into little pellets or tablets, Viko is a mild pain relief medicine commonly found on the Rim.  Although mildly addictive, it is relatively safe to use if done so carefully.  Great for chronic pain.  Often put into drinks to make 'purple drank'. -->
  <RC2_Viko.description>将佐佩（zope）与愈根（healroot）混合成糊状，干燥后研磨成粉末，再压制成小丸子或药片，维科（Viko）便是一种在边境（Rim）地区常见的轻度止痛药。虽然具有轻微成瘾性，但只要谨慎使用，相对安全。  非常适合缓解慢性疼痛。常被加入饮料中制成“紫色饮料”。</RC2_Viko.description>
